E AX3073 1411-as-boundaries.ax:25:4-6 undeclared-unsafe "`genericCast` erases `a` into `Float` with `as`, and its declaration does not say so" #"erases a reference" ^25:7-12:"source has type `a`; the conversion drops its ownership" ?24:1:"write `;@axiom:effect(unsafe)` above the declaration"~>";@axiom:effect(unsafe)\n" ?"keep the value in a typed binding, or use `addrOf` when the question is identity. An erasing cast drops the type and the share" ?"the unsafe tag marks a trusted boundary: you must make every well-typed call safe. It leaves ordinary type, effect and restriction checks in place"
E AX3049 1411-as-boundaries.ax:31:4-6 restriction-violated "`as` in the body of `restricted`, which claims `restrict(no-cast)`" ?"`no-cast` rejects explicit conversions in this body. Use an operation that preserves the required type, or remove the restriction. `no-cast:deep` also follows resolved callees; an unresolved path cannot establish the claim."
